From b72da12ca14cb255e86b91e0904d3fa47cba4b80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 05:49:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0193: OPTIONS at the title shows the options of the
 newest save on the cards, the ones a Continue applies: each save's header
 keeps a copy in its PocketStation bytes (0x50: "O", their count, a save
 number one past the highest seen, the SAVE_TAG_OPTIONS bytes;
 modTitleOptions), read when OPTIONS opens and nothing was changed there yet
 (modCardOptions, no card error screens). The option bytes are built and
 applied in one place (modOptionBytes, modApplyOptions)

---
 src/main/main_menu.c | 207 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 163 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

